WEBVTT

00:14.681 --> 00:17.642
5:35 P.M.

00:19.436 --> 00:20.353
It's raining.

00:30.363 --> 00:33.116
OCTOBER 28, 2011

00:37.370 --> 00:38.204
It was…

00:39.748 --> 00:40.749
always raining.

00:46.921 --> 00:47.797
What the…

00:53.011 --> 00:55.555
Hey, what are you making
the fuss for over there?

00:55.638 --> 00:57.891
You're getting on my nerves!

01:00.393 --> 01:02.479
I'm done for. I can't live any longer.

01:03.229 --> 01:04.814
He saw me last night.

01:06.024 --> 01:07.025
A male prison guard.

01:08.026 --> 01:11.071
I can't live anymore!

01:11.571 --> 01:14.574
Just kill me! Dammit!

01:15.075 --> 01:16.618
Man, what the hell?

01:17.202 --> 01:18.661
What's up with you?

01:19.329 --> 01:21.206
What's your name again?

01:21.289 --> 01:23.833
Jo… What was it?

01:24.417 --> 01:26.419
Jolyne, was it?

01:26.503 --> 01:28.755
What do you mean he saw you?

01:30.673 --> 01:33.676
Well, you know, like…

01:33.760 --> 01:35.887
The "M" word…

01:35.970 --> 01:36.971
What?

01:37.680 --> 01:40.600
In other words, I…

01:40.683 --> 01:42.227
Speak up!

01:42.310 --> 01:43.561
I'm trying to say…

01:44.604 --> 01:47.315
Well, like…

01:47.398 --> 01:51.402
Masturbation…

01:51.486 --> 01:53.279
- What?
- What?

01:53.363 --> 01:54.197
What?

01:54.280 --> 01:56.699
- Hold on.
- I won't be able to get married anymore!

01:57.325 --> 01:59.828
So wait, you were seen?

02:00.411 --> 02:02.539
A prison guard saw you touching yourself?

02:02.622 --> 02:07.085
Which guard was it?

02:08.753 --> 02:12.257
I woke up before sunrise.

02:13.049 --> 02:17.137
Something about the moonlight going in
through the shape of the window bars

02:17.220 --> 02:19.347
kind of, well,

02:20.598 --> 02:21.850
turned me on.

02:22.475 --> 02:24.978
So, I… Yes.

02:26.354 --> 02:28.940
When I came to my senses
and looked up from the bed,

02:29.023 --> 02:31.693
the youngest guard here was staring at me

02:31.776 --> 02:34.404
with a face like
he couldn't believe what he just saw.

02:34.904 --> 02:38.700
He stood right in front of this cell!

02:38.783 --> 02:40.618
Just kill me!

02:40.702 --> 02:44.664
I've seen him around. He's the one
that's kind of handsome, isn't he?

02:45.456 --> 02:46.499
Oh, my god.

02:47.000 --> 02:49.878
So how much did he see?

02:50.587 --> 02:54.841
I'll get to the point.
How low were your panties?

02:54.924 --> 02:56.885
Man, you're really after me.

02:56.968 --> 02:58.553
Like hell I'd tell you.

02:59.304 --> 03:01.014
But I learned my lesson.

03:01.514 --> 03:05.602
I'll never masturbate again ever
as long as I'm alive!

03:05.685 --> 03:07.520
I swear it!

03:08.104 --> 03:10.481
I don't know about that. What?

03:11.065 --> 03:14.903
Man, how can you get
turned on with those bars?

03:14.986 --> 03:16.863
Shut it, snotface.

03:16.946 --> 03:20.283
Stop butting in, you airhead!

03:20.366 --> 03:22.160
As if you've never done it before.

03:23.077 --> 03:26.414
I'm not dirty-minded like you lowlifes.

03:26.497 --> 03:30.418
And who the hell are you?
You want to bet on who can last longer?

03:30.501 --> 03:32.921
Idiot, how is this a bet?

03:33.004 --> 03:35.381
Masturbation is done in secret.

03:35.465 --> 03:38.301
How can we prove that we haven't done it?

03:40.428 --> 03:45.600
What if I told you that the joint
on your left ring finger tells all?

03:46.309 --> 03:49.020
You're in here for sexual assault,
aren't you?

03:49.604 --> 03:51.314
Your ring finger's discolored.

04:03.534 --> 04:07.914
Inmate 21, 22, and 29.

04:07.997 --> 04:09.582
You're getting transferred.

04:09.666 --> 04:11.584
Standby at the bars.

04:11.668 --> 04:14.087
Reach your arms out of the cell.

04:17.632 --> 04:20.343
What you said
about the ring finger, was it true?

04:20.843 --> 04:22.011
Or like fortune-telling?

04:23.221 --> 04:24.597
You're Japanese, aren't you?

04:26.724 --> 04:28.518
You're an interesting one.

04:28.601 --> 04:31.187
So what did you do?
Why did you get thrown in?

04:32.021 --> 04:33.231
I'm innocent.

04:45.702 --> 04:46.536
EPISODE 1: STONE OCEAN

04:46.619 --> 04:48.538
You were charged.

04:48.621 --> 04:50.206
For stealing and hit-and-run.

04:50.290 --> 04:51.124
VISITATION ROOM

04:51.207 --> 04:53.918
You were arrested
for robbery twice in the past.

04:54.002 --> 04:55.586
You won't be granted parole.

04:55.670 --> 04:57.171
In other words, Jojo,

04:57.255 --> 05:01.175
you will be transferred
to Green Dolphin's holding cell

05:01.759 --> 05:04.012
where you'll be tried at the court.

05:04.595 --> 05:06.472
Don't call me Jojo.

05:06.556 --> 05:08.308
Only my mom calls me that.

05:08.933 --> 05:12.437
And what's this criminal history?
Sure, I borrowed a bike without asking.

05:13.104 --> 05:15.648
I was 14 at the time!

05:15.732 --> 05:17.817
Like I said, I'm innocent!

05:18.318 --> 05:20.862
You better defend me at any cost.
I'm coughing up money.

05:21.446 --> 05:25.074
Yes, I will do my best
for you and the law.

05:25.658 --> 05:26.868
Dammit.

05:27.535 --> 05:30.038
Also, when do I get to see my mom?

05:30.788 --> 05:32.332
You know she's tender-hearted.

05:32.415 --> 05:34.125
She's a little worn out.

05:34.208 --> 05:36.461
Most of all, she's worried sick about you.

05:37.045 --> 05:38.588
She brought you a few things.

05:39.672 --> 05:42.467
You won't have to wear a uniform
while awaiting your sentence.

05:42.550 --> 05:44.844
Here's your change,
a book, and a magazine.

05:45.386 --> 05:46.888
Not to mention your homework.

05:49.974 --> 05:51.684
What is this?

05:51.768 --> 05:53.394
It seems to be a charm of some sort.

05:54.353 --> 05:56.647
There's a tiny stone inside.

05:57.231 --> 05:58.858
Your father had given it to your mother

05:59.442 --> 06:03.154
to pass it on to you
when you're in trouble.

06:03.821 --> 06:04.989
What did you say?

06:05.073 --> 06:06.365
That hurts!

06:09.744 --> 06:12.455
It hurts!

06:12.955 --> 06:14.999
Are you okay, Jolyne?

06:15.083 --> 06:17.585
What's that screaming for? Be quiet!

06:17.668 --> 06:18.920
It's nothing!

06:19.629 --> 06:21.214
It was just a pinch.

06:22.840 --> 06:24.383
Is this a stone?

06:24.884 --> 06:27.512
Where did you hear about my dad?

06:28.096 --> 06:31.724
Your mother is attempting to contact him.

06:31.808 --> 06:33.309
His daughter faces
a great predicament, after all.

06:38.314 --> 06:40.858
As you know,
your father is a marine biologist.

06:41.359 --> 06:44.278
He is conducting research in Africa

06:44.362 --> 06:46.447
and he hasn't been able to
fly out here yet.

06:46.531 --> 06:48.866
She's trying to fly him here?

06:48.950 --> 06:50.409
No way in hell he'll come.

06:50.493 --> 06:51.619
He's…

06:52.286 --> 06:53.788
That bastard…

06:53.871 --> 06:56.457
I don't need this cursed charm of his!

07:01.796 --> 07:02.672
What the…

07:06.968 --> 07:08.094
What's the matter?

07:08.761 --> 07:11.055
It's nothing. When is your next visit?

07:11.639 --> 07:12.723
In two days,

07:12.807 --> 07:15.601
at the visitation room of
Green Dolphin Prison's holding cell.

07:20.481 --> 07:24.110
Hey, Jolyne, I thought you were innocent.

07:25.611 --> 07:30.408
Though it's a probationary cell,
it's still under Green Dolphin Prison.

07:30.491 --> 07:32.076
If you're transferred there--

07:32.160 --> 07:33.661
The trial will clear my name.

07:34.787 --> 07:36.873
I won't go to prison.

07:37.707 --> 07:40.042
We are crossing the bridge now.

07:40.126 --> 07:41.919
We'll arrive in ten minutes.

07:42.003 --> 07:43.629
That didn't take long.

07:43.713 --> 07:45.673
Ten minutes until we're there.

07:45.756 --> 07:48.885
- What? Who said that--
- I heard it from the driver's seat.

07:48.968 --> 07:51.679
You can't hear them from here.

07:51.762 --> 07:53.473
We're crossing the bridge now.

07:53.556 --> 07:55.099
ETA is ten minutes.

07:55.183 --> 07:56.142
Understood.

07:57.685 --> 08:01.772
How did you know?
Is this another fortune-telling of yours?

08:02.940 --> 08:05.401
Yes, it's strange, isn't it?

08:06.110 --> 08:07.570
I'm not sure either.

08:07.653 --> 08:10.156
You sure are a funny one.

08:10.239 --> 08:12.408
I'm Ermes Costello.

08:12.992 --> 08:15.036
I robbed a gas station.

08:15.119 --> 08:18.122
It's my second time,
so I'll be sentenced without a doubt.

08:20.041 --> 08:21.834
Nice to meet you, Ermes.

08:35.932 --> 08:37.725
NOVEMBER 6, 2:32 P.M.

08:37.808 --> 08:41.854
Green Dolphin Street State Prison
and the adjunct probationary cell,

08:41.938 --> 08:44.273
aka "The Aquarium."

08:44.899 --> 08:47.902
The premises cover 120 square kilometers.

08:47.985 --> 08:53.533
Imprisoned here
are 708 males, 523 females,

08:53.616 --> 08:56.953
and 452 minors under 18 years of age.

08:58.496 --> 08:59.497
Hey Jolyne.

09:00.081 --> 09:01.832
You got cash on you?

09:03.000 --> 09:04.168
Maybe.

09:04.252 --> 09:06.796
Hey, I'm warning you.

09:07.505 --> 09:09.507
If you don't bring in a few Benjamins,

09:09.590 --> 09:12.468
you might end up dead.

09:13.052 --> 09:15.054
If you don't have any on you now,

09:15.137 --> 09:18.349
make sure to have someone
bring them to you at a visitation.

09:18.432 --> 09:21.936
And you're assuming
I'll be thrown in because?

09:22.728 --> 09:24.230
I'm just giving you a heads up.

09:24.313 --> 09:27.149
As if you've got cash yourself.

09:27.233 --> 09:29.360
The guards would've taken them
right out of your hand.

09:29.443 --> 09:30.987
How naive, Jolyne.

09:31.070 --> 09:33.322
There are many ways to stash them.

09:33.406 --> 09:37.868
You mean, you stuck them
up your ass or the other hole?

09:37.952 --> 09:39.453
Gross!

09:39.537 --> 09:41.998
I thought that was a movie thing!

09:42.081 --> 09:42.957
Dumbass,

09:43.040 --> 09:46.377
that's the first place they inspect.

09:46.460 --> 09:47.670
Then where?

09:48.546 --> 09:50.590
Ah, you got them in your boobs, don't you?

09:50.673 --> 09:53.467
You slid some cash in
on top of some silicone implants?

09:56.846 --> 09:58.347
No way! I was kidding!

09:58.889 --> 10:01.267
You found me out.

10:01.350 --> 10:02.893
Don't tell a soul, though.

10:03.769 --> 10:05.354
See the stitches?

10:06.022 --> 10:08.107
It bleeds a little when I take them out,

10:08.190 --> 10:10.860
but I got five 20s in one

10:10.943 --> 10:12.862
and a 50 under the other.

10:19.160 --> 10:22.705
We're at Green Dolphin Street Prison's
probationary cell.

10:23.289 --> 10:25.791
Inmate 21 and 29, get off.

10:25.875 --> 10:28.252
Inmate 22, Ermes Costello,

10:28.336 --> 10:29.879
this isn't your stop.

10:51.609 --> 10:55.571
Welcome back, Ermes Costello.
What brought you back?

10:56.238 --> 10:58.115
Robbery? An injury incident?

10:58.199 --> 10:59.367
What?

11:01.410 --> 11:03.329
Did you say something to me just now?

11:03.913 --> 11:06.248
Inmate 21, look straight ahead!

11:09.710 --> 11:11.003
Spill it, Ermes.

11:12.546 --> 11:14.256
I know you've got some.

11:14.340 --> 11:15.257
You got cash, right?

11:16.300 --> 11:19.929
Cash? I got none, I'm afraid.

11:20.012 --> 11:23.599
I hear them! Something's not right!

11:24.225 --> 11:27.269
These guards can't hear them at all!

11:27.353 --> 11:29.438
It's just like
when we were crossing the bridge.

11:29.522 --> 11:31.148
I can hear faraway voices!

11:31.232 --> 11:32.358
Ouch!

11:33.401 --> 11:35.069
This is…

11:37.363 --> 11:39.532
Spit them out, Ermes.

11:40.491 --> 11:44.078
This is your second time in the Aquarium.
I know you're carrying some!

11:44.703 --> 11:46.872
What is this?

11:46.956 --> 11:49.417
Do not talk, Inmate 21!

11:50.709 --> 11:53.504
Can't they see these threads
springing out of my hand?

11:54.088 --> 11:56.799
Okay, I'll take them out now.

12:01.929 --> 12:03.514
You know, Ermes.

12:04.348 --> 12:08.060
This isn't enough to prove our friendship.

12:08.978 --> 12:11.522
I bet you got more on your body somewhere.

12:11.605 --> 12:14.525
Oops, the bus is braking!

12:20.489 --> 12:23.451
Please let me off the hook with the 50.

12:24.034 --> 12:27.329
I've got no one who can give me more.

12:28.289 --> 12:29.123
Please,

12:29.874 --> 12:33.002
I'll die in there without the money!

12:33.085 --> 12:36.505
You got big tits
for someone with a big build.

12:37.256 --> 12:38.924
Those tits are suspicious.

12:39.425 --> 12:40.843
Let's search them.

12:42.344 --> 12:43.804
Hold her still.

12:43.888 --> 12:44.805
Sure.

12:44.889 --> 12:47.933
No… Stop!

12:50.311 --> 12:51.437
Let go!

12:52.146 --> 12:54.523
Who do you think I am, bitch?

13:16.378 --> 13:17.213
What…

13:22.593 --> 13:24.345
What just sprung out?

13:26.639 --> 13:28.807
What is this… Could it be…

13:29.642 --> 13:31.060
Did that stone cause this?

13:31.977 --> 13:36.273
What did my dad send me?

13:41.278 --> 13:42.112
NOVEMBER 8, 11 A.M.

13:42.196 --> 13:43.030
Hey,

13:43.113 --> 13:44.532
remember how I tossed that charm…

13:44.615 --> 13:45.449
PROBATIONARY JAIL

13:45.533 --> 13:48.035
…at the visitation room?

13:48.118 --> 13:50.079
I wonder where it ended up.

13:50.162 --> 13:52.873
Well, I do not recall.

13:52.957 --> 13:55.626
Anyhow, let's discuss our case.

13:55.709 --> 13:58.837
If you wish to claim your innocence,
I need to know this detail.

13:59.463 --> 14:02.841
During that hit-and-run, were you the one

14:04.260 --> 14:05.386
in the driver's seat?

14:09.098 --> 14:12.268
OCTOBER 28, 5:32 P.M.

14:13.852 --> 14:15.312
WEST PALM BEACH, WEST FLORIDA

14:16.522 --> 14:18.941
So about your nickname.

14:19.024 --> 14:23.779
Romeo, can I call you
"Rocchu" from now on?

14:23.862 --> 14:24.738
Sure thing.

14:24.822 --> 14:27.533
Only when you're gargling mouthwash.

14:27.616 --> 14:29.994
What, you don't like it?

14:30.077 --> 14:34.206
Why not? Rocchu, I'm hungies!

14:34.290 --> 14:36.584
How about that? Doesn't that fly?

14:36.667 --> 14:37.751
No way.

14:37.835 --> 14:40.212
My friends can't hear that.

14:40.296 --> 14:43.257
I love the way it's all lovey-dovey.

14:43.340 --> 14:47.636
My mom has called me "Jojo"
ever since I was a baby.

14:48.220 --> 14:49.763
I want you to call me Jojo too, Rocchu.

14:50.347 --> 14:51.515
Hell no.

14:52.808 --> 14:55.603
Anyway, I'm thirsty. Let me take a sip.

14:55.686 --> 14:58.939
You can't. It's a cocktail
with a strong alcohol content, 10%!

14:59.023 --> 15:00.649
I'll be safe.

15:00.733 --> 15:03.736
No, you can't. I said no.

15:04.778 --> 15:07.239
Romeo!

15:15.956 --> 15:18.417
Romeo… Just now, we…

15:19.084 --> 15:20.085
Romeo!

15:23.589 --> 15:26.216
This isn't happening… No!

15:26.300 --> 15:27.134
This is bad!

15:33.432 --> 15:37.227
We need to get help.
Romeo, call an ambulance!

15:39.688 --> 15:42.524
Jolyne, please.

15:42.608 --> 15:45.194
Please don't do that. Don't call.

15:45.277 --> 15:47.446
Listen to yourself! We need to get help!

15:47.529 --> 15:50.115
He died instantly!

15:50.824 --> 15:52.868
You're going to run? No!

15:52.952 --> 15:55.829
This was an accident! And we can't run!

15:55.913 --> 15:57.790
This car is the evidence!

15:57.873 --> 15:59.833
Let's say the car was stolen!

15:59.917 --> 16:00.960
But…

16:01.043 --> 16:02.294
Jolyne!

16:02.378 --> 16:04.630
Jolyne, if I'm arrested,

16:05.339 --> 16:07.132
our future together is over!

16:07.216 --> 16:09.718
Not to mention, I'll go to jail.

16:09.802 --> 16:11.845
We'll be separated!

16:11.929 --> 16:15.766
So please! Don't you love me?

16:15.849 --> 16:17.851
Of course, I do.

16:17.935 --> 16:19.770
But this is…

16:21.814 --> 16:24.942
A car is coming.
We're finished if we're seen!

16:26.986 --> 16:30.364
Jolyne! I need a hand!

16:31.031 --> 16:33.951
He's dead, like I thought!

16:34.034 --> 16:36.829
Please. Help me, Jolyne!

16:36.912 --> 16:38.789
I love you!

16:39.373 --> 16:43.502
Jolyne!

16:53.345 --> 16:57.141
Jolyne, the police believe
that you stole the car

16:57.224 --> 16:58.976
and caused the accident
while under the influence.

16:59.059 --> 17:01.937
And what is Romeo's claim?

17:02.521 --> 17:04.023
He claims his car was stolen.

17:04.732 --> 17:07.192
Goddammit… I want to die!

17:07.776 --> 17:10.279
Was Romeo the one driving?

17:11.989 --> 17:13.282
I can't tell you that.

17:13.365 --> 17:14.450
All right, then.

17:14.533 --> 17:15.492
This is what we'll do.

17:16.076 --> 17:19.204
Jolyne, do you know what a "plea deal" is?

17:20.164 --> 17:23.333
If you admit all of your crimes,

17:23.417 --> 17:25.627
they'll reduce your DUI charge.

17:26.211 --> 17:29.298
Then you'll only get sentenced
for stealing and involuntary manslaughter.

17:29.381 --> 17:32.051
You'll be paroled after a year or so.

17:32.634 --> 17:36.764
I told you to fight for innocence!

17:36.847 --> 17:39.975
I understand, but we need to compromise.

17:40.559 --> 17:43.979
If they find you guilty during the trial,
you'll get at least five years.

17:44.563 --> 17:46.273
We don't have time, Jolyne.

17:46.940 --> 17:49.943
We must agree to the deal
before the trial starts!

17:52.696 --> 17:54.448
Defendant Cujoh.

17:54.531 --> 17:59.453
You voluntarily admit to
the details of the plea, is that correct?

18:01.246 --> 18:02.831
Yes, I admit.

18:03.415 --> 18:08.420
This court will consider
that the defendant, Jolyne Cujoh,

18:08.504 --> 18:13.133
admits to the crime and consider
her release since the murder

18:13.217 --> 18:15.344
was not premeditated.

18:15.427 --> 18:19.348
However, this court cannot condone
the act of disposing of the victim,

18:19.431 --> 18:22.142
who was still alive, in a swamp,

18:22.226 --> 18:24.520
effectively murdering him.

18:24.603 --> 18:26.396
The victim was alive?

18:26.939 --> 18:27.856
What is that about?

18:27.940 --> 18:30.442
What is he saying?

18:31.026 --> 18:32.444
A murder?

18:39.284 --> 18:43.831
This court finds and determines
that the defendant, Jolyne Cujoh,

18:43.914 --> 18:47.876
shall be confined to
Green Dolphin Street State Prison

18:47.960 --> 18:50.254
for 15 years.

18:50.337 --> 18:51.296
This court is adjourned.

18:52.047 --> 18:54.091
What? Hold on…

18:54.758 --> 18:57.010
Fifteen years? How could you?

18:57.803 --> 18:59.388
I struck a deal!

18:59.888 --> 19:01.348
I agreed!

19:02.808 --> 19:04.351
Didn't I, Mr. Lawyer?

19:04.434 --> 19:06.311
I've done my best.

19:06.812 --> 19:10.149
Take care, Jolyne Cujoh.

19:11.024 --> 19:13.152
Hold it. Where are you going?

19:13.235 --> 19:14.695
What are you saying?

19:14.778 --> 19:18.198
Fifteen years? What's this about?
That's not what we agreed on!

19:18.282 --> 19:19.116
Hold still!

19:19.199 --> 19:22.536
I said hold it! You bastard!

19:25.122 --> 19:28.375
You don't need to worry anymore.
The sentence has been finalized.

19:29.042 --> 19:32.713
She agreed to the plea deal.
She won't be able to appeal.

19:32.796 --> 19:37.134
There won't be any further investigations.
Congratulations, Romeo.

19:37.634 --> 19:40.345
Thank you. You saved my life.

19:42.222 --> 19:45.726
Please thank your rich father.

19:47.019 --> 19:51.481
Romeo, you…

19:52.858 --> 19:55.819
Romeo!

19:55.903 --> 19:58.322
Fifteen years…

19:58.405 --> 20:01.491
My entire youth, 15 years!

20:19.593 --> 20:22.721
From now on, in addition to
the name your parents gave you

20:22.804 --> 20:24.932
when they birthed you little shits,

20:25.015 --> 20:28.143
the state will give you
an inmate number, so be grateful!

20:28.727 --> 20:31.730
This prison is Category Level 4,

20:31.813 --> 20:33.398
Maximum Security!

20:33.899 --> 20:35.859
FE40536.

20:35.943 --> 20:39.112
When you hear this number,
whether you're taking a shit or eating,

20:39.196 --> 20:40.781
it's referring to you!

20:40.864 --> 20:42.741
Beat that into your head!

20:43.867 --> 20:47.955
FE40536, we will now conduct
a body search.

20:48.038 --> 20:52.167
Throw everything you're wearing
into this tray and…

20:52.251 --> 20:54.378
Strip! Begin!

20:54.962 --> 20:58.173
Remember, education is the first thing
you need to do to trash.

20:58.257 --> 20:59.967
Make sure to humiliate them.

21:00.050 --> 21:01.718
What's taking your time?

21:01.802 --> 21:05.180
"Strip" means your panties too!

21:05.264 --> 21:07.683
Now, show me your ass…

21:07.766 --> 21:09.851
Are all fours okay?

21:09.935 --> 21:11.645
Or do you want me to lie on my back?

21:11.728 --> 21:13.981
I can perform
a stunt or two if you'd like.

21:27.327 --> 21:28.203
You bastard…

21:29.913 --> 21:32.416
You think you can stroll out of here?

21:32.499 --> 21:34.793
It sure is hot in here.

21:34.876 --> 21:36.420
My shirt is covered in sweat.

21:36.503 --> 21:37.921
It might rain.

21:38.588 --> 21:40.966
Would you like to take
a break in the director's office?

21:41.466 --> 21:42.801
The AC is on.

21:42.884 --> 21:44.553
Oh, don't inconvenience yourself.

21:44.636 --> 21:47.931
All the documents have been submitted.

21:48.432 --> 21:52.269
This heat is nothing
compared to my client's fate.

21:53.020 --> 21:54.896
For her to receive
a 15-year sentence at her age…

21:55.605 --> 21:57.190
If only I were able to help.

21:57.274 --> 22:00.819
No, you are a spectacular lawyer.

22:00.902 --> 22:02.195
Oh, speaking of your client,

22:02.279 --> 22:04.614
Jolyne Cujoh,

22:04.698 --> 22:07.492
she asked me to give this letter to you.

22:08.118 --> 22:09.661
The content's been cleared.

22:11.413 --> 22:12.539
I see.

22:18.128 --> 22:19.588
Pass this on to him too.

22:20.172 --> 22:23.383
Feeling comfy? But you will keep sweating.

22:23.467 --> 22:26.219
Now and forever.

22:26.303 --> 22:27.387
What the hell?

22:30.557 --> 22:32.601
I can't reach him right now

22:33.101 --> 22:35.020
and I'm powerless.

22:35.103 --> 22:37.230
I can't wait 15 years.

22:37.731 --> 22:39.149
I'll come to see you.

22:39.733 --> 22:40.817
And Romeo,

22:41.693 --> 22:44.362
farewell, my first love.

22:47.824 --> 22:50.702
Between that dingy place and my car,

22:51.203 --> 22:52.954
the air sure is different.

22:53.538 --> 22:58.293
To think that I have to breathe
the same air as those scum with this job.

23:03.173 --> 23:04.132
I can't breathe…

23:04.216 --> 23:07.094
This thread… is choking my neck!

23:08.678 --> 23:11.306
The AC might be drying it out!

23:13.141 --> 23:15.310
I must… remove it!

23:28.824 --> 23:30.951
This is another way to use it.

23:31.034 --> 23:33.245
It activates with my thoughts

23:33.328 --> 23:35.413
and I can manipulate it
with the force of my mind.

23:35.497 --> 23:38.542
He wanted me to protect myself

23:39.042 --> 23:41.169
using that charm.

23:43.463 --> 23:45.841
This will be fun.

23:45.924 --> 23:48.927
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
